(7. The Personal Guarantor relies on the clean slate principle. That reliance) Tj
T*
(is misplaced. In Committee of Creditors of Essar Steel India Ltd. v. Satish) Tj
T*
(Kumar Gupta & Ors., \(2020\) 8 SCC 531, the Court observed at paragraph 67 that) Tj
T*
("a successful resolution applicant is entitled to a complete discharge of all) Tj
T*
(antecedent obligations of every guarantor and surety standing behind the) Tj
T*
(corporate debtor, whose liabilities are extinguished upon approval of the) Tj
T*
(plan.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. That principle is directed at the resolution applicant and the corporate) Tj
T*
(debtor. It says nothing about a surety who has furnished an independent) Tj
T*
(contract of guarantee.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. It is further submitted that Ghanashyam Mishra & Sons Pvt. Ltd. v.) Tj
T*
(Edelweiss Asset Reconstruction Co. Ltd., \(2021\) 9 SCC 657 establishes that a) Tj
T*
(secured creditor forfeits its right to enforce a personal guarantee where it) Tj
T*
(has participated in the meetings of the committee of creditors and voted in) Tj
T*
(favour of the resolution plan.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. Finally, the Personal Guarantor relies on Dr. Vishnu Kumar Agarwal v.) Tj
T*
(Piramal Enterprises Ltd., Company Appeal \(AT\) \(Insolvency\) No. 346 of 2018.) Tj
T*
(That decision bars a second insolvency process against a co-guarantor for the) Tj
T*
(same debt. It does not bar enforcement of the guarantee itself.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(V. PRAYER) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. For the reasons set out above, it is respectfully prayed that this) Tj
T*
(Hon'ble Tribunal be pleased to hold that the proceedings against the Personal) Tj
T*
(Guarantor are maintainable notwithstanding the moratorium in respect of the) Tj
T*
(Corporate Debtor.) Tj
T*
ET
